      <h2 class="section-title">About {d.fullName}</h2>
      <p><strong>{d.fullName}</strong>, also known simply as <strong>{d.shortName}</strong>, is the national monument of {d.country}, erected to mark the Lahore Resolution of 1940. Standing at the centre of Iqbal Park in the Walled City of {d.city}, it draws visitors from across the country and the world.</p>
      <p class="breadcrumb">{d.fullName} &rarr; {d.city} &rarr; {d.region} &rarr; {d.country}</p>
